  "notes": [
    "Battle results store the rank in ResultSnapshot.Key00. A completed PvE run casts each snapshot rank to EGameBattleResultEvaluation before RecordPvEResult.",
    "EvaluationMin and EvaluationMax are parallel arrays. The picker applies the inclusive rank range only when both bounds are nonzero, and a rank of 255 discards all rank-restricted candidates.",
    "GetResultScoreRank chooses among mode-specific C, B, A, and S threshold rows. If no row matches, it returns C."
